  "global_rules": {
    "albedo_floor_hex": "#1D1916",
    "albedo_ceiling_hex": "#EBE7DF",
    "gold_max_frame_fraction": 0.05,
    "lacquer_red_max_frame_fraction": 0.08,
    "glimmer_max_frame_fraction_day": 0.03,
    "glimmer_max_frame_fraction_night": 0.12,
    "glimmer_max_frame_fraction_set_piece": 0.35,
    "shadow_tint_hex": "#0E4A55",
    "never_neutral_black_shadows": true,
    "mote_direction_rule": "rising + warm (glimmer_lift) = released; sideways/down/seaward + cool (glimmer_held) = held",
    "sea_glow_rule": "sea_glow emission present in every night frame (energy 0.04-0.15; >= 0.08 once the sun is below -6 deg) until ending_dock, where it is 0. Night value order: flames and glimmer cores > moonlit stone > glowing sea > sky. The glowing sea is the brightest WATER value and the frame's teal field: glow on/off >= 1.5x luminance, moonlit stone <= 2.5x the glowing sea (author moon key energy <= 2.5 x sea-glow energy). color_script.md rule 3."
